WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.327
Step 2 signs in to the
stage's tenant, collects,

2
00:00:03.327 --> 00:00:06.250
and runs the preflight, which only reads.

3
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.325
Six checks.

4
00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:09.562
The settings file names this stage.

5
00:00:09.562 --> 00:00:13.712
The collection matches its manifest
and was read in the right tenant.

6
00:00:13.712 --> 00:00:17.463
The emergency access group is
excluded from every network

7
00:00:17.463 --> 00:00:20.525
policy in the tenant, not
just the ones in the plan.

8
00:00:20.525 --> 00:00:24.550
The network diagnostic setting
exists, so logs come before the ring.

9
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:28.463
Every function the desired state
enables has an approved decision.

10
00:00:28.463 --> 00:00:31.699
And in production, the test
stage's evidence passes.

11
00:00:31.699 --> 00:00:36.548
Any failure stops the stage; the pilot
fixture fails the emergency check,

12
00:00:36.548 --> 00:00:39.600
because of the Finance
policy from Chapter 6.
